      ],
      "text": "Vision:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " The current vision strd = provided on the form. When other than the Snellen chart = used, give test results in Snellen-comparable values. When recording distance vision, use 20 ft as norm. Record the vision acuity results and indicate if the driver can recognize and distinguish among traffic control signals and devices showing red, green, and amber colors; has monocular vision; has been referred to an ophthalmologist or optometrist; and if documentation has been received from an ophthalmologist or optometrist."
